sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box rgb(245,183,61,0.18) Initiator
        participant V as voiceai campaign
    end
    box rgb(247,71,55,0.10) voiceai
        participant T as talko_api_server :8004
        participant E as voiceai engine :5001
    end
    box rgb(31,38,80,0.08) talko-service :8003
        participant K as talko-service
    end
    box rgb(54,70,77,0.10) Telecom
        participant TT as Tata Tele
        participant C as Customer
    end

    V->>T: POST /talko/call {agent_id, to_number}
    activate T
    T->>K: POST /call {ai_bridge, did, ctx.voiceai_agent_id}
    deactivate T
    activate K
    K->>K: CDR insert + pending_context
    K->>TT: C2C dial (customer_number, caller_id)
    deactivate K
    TT->>C: PSTN call
    C->>TT: Answer
    TT->>K: WS start {callSid, streamSid}
    activate K
    K->>K: DID resolve + pending ctx<br/>voiceai route → skip makun-ai
    K->>E: POST /ws-ticket (Bearer key)
    E-->>K: ticket (single-use, 60s)
    K->>E: WS /chat/v1/agent?token= + forward start
    E->>E: agent session warm
    loop media relay (~50 frames/sec)
        TT->>K: media {payload, chunk}
        K->>E: media {payload, +timestamp}
        E->>K: media {agent audio}
        K->>TT: media + mark
        TT->>K: mark ack
        K->>E: mark ack (voiceai names only)
    end
    TT->>K: stop
    K->>E: forward stop + close
    K->>K: CDR update + recording link
    deactivate K
